cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PsychScanner in your research, please cite the framework paper
  below. Task-specific instruments (Reality Monitoring, VVIQ) have their own
  citations under "references" — cite those alongside the framework paper if
  you use the corresponding bundled task.
